{"id":"schwierigkeit","lemma":"Schwierigkeit","pos":"noun","rank":962,"glosses":["difficulty, problem","trouble, difficulty, hardships, complications (NOTE: when in the plural, this word can retain a singular English abstract meaning)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃviːʁɪçkaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/57/De-Schwierigkeit.ogg/De-Schwierigkeit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Schwierigkeit","plural":"Schwierigkeiten"},"formAudio":{"Schwierigkeiten":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Schwierigkeiten.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Bist du in Schwierigkeiten?","en":"Are you in trouble?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392563","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Das ist nicht die einzige Schwierigkeit.","en":"That's not the only problem.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"only, sole","l":"einzig"},null]},{"text":"Er ist in großen Schwierigkeiten.","en":"He is in great trouble.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/592960","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},null]},{"text":"Er fand den Ort ohne Schwierigkeit.","en":"He had no difficulty in finding the place.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to find","l":"finden"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin in Schwierigkeiten.","en":"I'm in trouble.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/88104","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},null]}]}